title: "Aurora-GLM: Generalized Linear and Additive Models"
version: 0.7.0
date-released: 2025-12-06
url: "https://github.com/Matcraft94/Aurora-GLM"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Matcraft94/Aurora-GLM"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - glm
  - gam
  - gamm
